Maerkdown (apps/maerkdown)
=========================

The word-as-widget markdown editor. Its document model, layout,
renderer and editing logic are original to this repository.

Its EXTENDED INLINE SYNTAX — the delimiters, and the reading of what
each one means — is taken from the Extended Markdown Syntax plugin for
Obsidian:

    https://github.com/kotaindah55/extended-markdown-syntax

    ++insertion++   underline
    ||spoiler||     hidden until revealed
    ==highlight==   marked text
    ^superscript^   raised
    ~subscript~     lowered

That project is MIT licensed; its notice is reproduced verbatim in
LICENSE-extended-markdown-syntax in this folder.

    Copyright (c) 2025 Kotaindah55 (Sheva ihza)

No code was copied. The syntax rules were read from that project's
README and docs/rule.md and reimplemented from scratch in Aether
(mdown.ae), against this editor's own word-grained document model.
